    <textTemplates>
        <name>JoinderReceivedEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;RE: {!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c} {!$Record.Bene_Suffix__c}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Dear {!$Record.Grantor_First_Name__c},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The Arc of Texas Master Pooled Trust has received the Joinder Agreement for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;An individual is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;NOT enrolled&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the Trust until the Joinder Agreement has been reviewed and approved by The Arc of Texas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;BEFORE THE SUB-ACCOUNT CAN BE ESTABLISHED,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the following steps must be completed:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Review&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Our team will carefully review the Joinder Agreement and supplemental documents to ensure everything is complete and accurate. If more information is required or any changes to the Joinder Agreement are necessary, a member of our Enrollment Team will reach out to you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Approval&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– If&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;everything&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is in order, the Joinder Agreement will be approved and signed by The Arc of Texas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;System Entry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– The information will be entered into our system and the sub-account will be established. A (4) digit Trust sub-account number&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;will only&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;be assigned once funding has been received.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mailing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Copies of the Joinder Agreement and related materials will be mailed to the Primary Representative (Trusts II, IV) or Grantor (Trusts I, III) list on the Joinder Agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This entire process can take&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;a month or more&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;to complete. We appreciate your patience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;any&amp;nbsp;questions&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;answered&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;this&amp;nbsp;email,&amp;nbsp;please&amp;nbsp;contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@arcare.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 92, 171);&quot;&gt;info@arcare.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;call&amp;nbsp;512-454-6694.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;﻿Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;THE MASTER POOLED TRUST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
